WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.449
Step 1. Open the Consents tab.

1.2
00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:07.653
In All Encounters, select View Encounter, then select the Consents tab.

1.3
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:12.404
By default, this list shows only encounters created today.

2.1
00:00:12.404 --> 00:00:16.528
Step 2. Open the Add Consent form. Select Add Consent.

2.2
00:00:16.528 --> 00:00:19.969
Care fills in some of the fields for you.

3.1
00:00:19.969 --> 00:00:26.698
Step 3. Check the dates. Consent Valid From cannot be earlier than Consent Given On,

3.2
00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:29.820
or later than Consent Valid Until.

4.1
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:34.331
Step 4. Select the decision. Permit is already selected.

4.2
00:00:34.331 --> 00:00:40.005
Keep it, or select Deny; selecting Permit again clears the decision.

5.1
00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:42.205
Step 5. Select the category.

5.2
00:00:42.205 --> 00:00:46.940
Open the Category list, where each option shows a short description.

5.3
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.598
Care selects Treatment for you.

6.1
00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:54.236
Step 6. Select the status. Care selects Active for you.

6.2
00:00:54.236 --> 00:01:00.320
The other statuses are Inactive, Draft, Not Done and Entered in Error.

7.1
00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.150
Step 7. Enter a note.

7.2
00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:07.842
The Note field takes free text about the consent, and it is optional.

8.1
00:01:07.842 --> 00:01:13.393
Step 8. Add the files. Under Supporting Documents, choose Select Files,

8.2
00:01:13.393 --> 00:01:20.165
then Upload From Device or Open Camera. Each file needs a name in its File Name box.

9.1
00:01:20.165 --> 00:01:23.360
Step 9. Save the consent. Select Save.

9.2
00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:27.003
Care saves the consent, then uploads its files.

9.3
00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:31.223
The new consent shows first on the Consents tab.

10.1
00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:33.344
Step 10. Check the files.

10.2
00:01:33.344 --> 00:01:37.834
Select See Details, and check that each file shows Uploaded.

10.3
00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:41.852
The Add Consent form does not show file errors.
